  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion, carrot, and celery and cook until the vegetables are tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chicken to the saucepan and cook until browned, about 5-7 minutes.",
    "Add the curry powder and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the chicken broth, salt, and black pepper to the saucepan and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, until the chicken is cooked through, about 15-20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chopped Thai holy basil and plain Greek yogurt.",
    "Serve the curry hot over rice or with naan bread."
